        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "seby": {
              "text": "Every morning, the little prince pulls up tiny baobab shoots before they break his small planet."
            },
            "ale": {
              "text": "Good rose seeds and terrible baobab seeds grow on B 612. Every morning, the prince must pull up each young baobab shoot before its roots shatter his tiny world."
            },
            "emma": {
              "text": "There were terrible seeds on the little prince's planet: the seeds of the baobab. \"It is a question of discipline,\" the little prince told me later. \"After your morning toilet, you must carefully clean the planet.\" If the planet is too small, the baobabs burst it apart."
            }
          }
        },
