        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "seby": {
              "text": "When he feels sad, the little prince moves his chair to watch forty-four sunsets."
            },
            "ale": {
              "text": "His planet is so tiny that moving his chair a few paces brings another sunset. On a day of deep sadness, the little prince watched the sun go down forty-four times."
            },
            "emma": {
              "text": "On your tiny little planet, you merely had to pull your chair a few steps further. And you watched the twilight whenever you truly wished... \"One day, I saw the sun set forty-four times!\" \"You know... one loves the sunset, when one is really so sad...\""
            }
          }
        },
        "questions": null
