        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "seby": {
              "text": "On Earth, the prince lands in the desert. A tiny golden snake greets him softly."
            },
            "ale": {
              "text": "Arriving on the seventh planet, the little prince sees nobody around him. A slender moon-coloured snake glides across the warm sand and speaks to him in mysterious riddles."
            },
            "emma": {
              "text": "So the seventh planet was the Earth. Once on Earth, the little prince was quite surprised to see nobody at all, until a moon-coloured coil stirred softly in the sand. \"It is a little lonely in the desert...\" \"It is lonely among people too,\" said the snake."
            }
          }
        },
        "questions": null
