        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "seby": {
              "text": "A friendly fox appears under an apple tree. He asks the little prince to tame him."
            },
            "ale": {
              "text": "A clever fox appears under an apple tree and explains what taming means: creating precious ties. If they become friends, they will truly need each other and be unique."
            },
            "emma": {
              "text": "It was then that the fox appeared beneath the apple tree. \"I am not tamed,\" said the fox. \"It means to establish ties...\" \"To me, you will be unique in all the world. To you, I shall be unique in all the world...\" And the fox said: \"Please... tame me!\""
            }
          }
        },
