        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "seby": {
              "text": "He cared lovingly for his rose. The fox reveals his secret: one sees well with the heart."
            },
            "ale": {
              "text": "Looking back at the rose garden, the little prince realises why his own rose is unique: because of the time he spent caring for her. The fox whispers his timeless secret."
            },
            "emma": {
              "text": "And he went back to the fox. \"Goodbye,\" said the fox. \"Here is my secret. It is very simple: one sees clearly only with the heart. What is essential is invisible to the eyes. The time you wasted for your rose makes her important. You are responsible for your rose.\""
            }
          }
        },
