        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "seby": {
              "text": "Both friends feel very thirsty in the desert. Beneath the stars, they seek a hidden well."
            },
            "ale": {
              "text": "Grown-ups rush aboard express trains without knowing what they seek. Through the quiet starry desert night, the thirsty pilot and the little prince walk together towards a hidden well."
            },
            "emma": {
              "text": "\"Only children know what they are looking for,\" said the little prince. Night fell, and the stars began to shine across the vast desert. \"What makes the desert beautiful,\" said the prince, \"is that it hides a well... What gives them beauty is invisible!\""
            }
          }
        },
